Abstract Class-------------------
            Declared with abstract class
            
            Can have both **__abstract methods (no body) & and concrete methods (with body)__**
            
            Can have instance variables (state)__
            
            Can have constructors_____
            
            A class extends only one abstract class → single inheritance
            
            Methods/fields can be private, protected, public, or default
            
            Ideal when subclasses share common state + behavior

